<div class="page" id="page-steps">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-glow"></div><div class="page-hero-glow2"></div>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a onclick="navigate('home')">Home</a><span>/</span><span style="color:white;">USMLE Guide</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">YOUR USMLE GUIDE</div>
    <h1>Your Complete <span>USMLE Guide</span></h1>
    <p>Everything you need to know about the USMLE — what each step covers, how to prepare, and the tools to get you there.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- USMLE GUIDE -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:white;">
    <div class="sec-center" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div class="stag">WHAT IS THE USMLE?</div>
      <h2 class="stitle">Understanding the <span>USMLE</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;">The <strong style="color:var(--navy);">United States Medical Licensing Examination (USMLE)</strong> is a three-step examination required for medical licensure in the United States. It assesses a physician's ability to apply knowledge, concepts, and principles that are essential for safe and effective patient care.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:28px;" class="guide-grid">
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">📘</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Step 1</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">Tests foundational science concepts — anatomy, physiology, biochemistry, pharmacology, pathology, and microbiology. Taken during or after the second year of medical school.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;padding:8px 18px;" onclick="openStepModal()">Start Step 1 →</button>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">🏥</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Step 2 CK</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">Assesses clinical knowledge and the ability to provide patient care under supervision. Covers internal medicine, surgery, pediatrics, psychiatry, and OB/GYN. Taken in the fourth year.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;padding:8px 18px;" onclick="openStepModal()">Start Step 2 →</button>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">🎓</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Step 3</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">The final licensing exam, testing independent patient management. Covers biostatistics, clinical case management, and pharmacotherapy. Taken during residency training.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;padding:8px 18px;" onclick="openStepModal()">Start Step 3 →</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY THE USMLE MATTERS -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--off-white);">
    <div class="sec-center" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div class="stag">WHY IT MATTERS</div>
      <h2 class="stitle">Why the USMLE Matters for <span>Your Career</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:28px;">The USMLE is more than an exam — it's the gateway to practicing medicine in the United States. Your scores influence residency placement, specialty options, and long-term career trajectory. A strong USMLE performance opens doors to competitive specialties and top residency programs.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;" class="guide-grid">
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;">🏆</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Residency Matching</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">USMLE scores are a key factor in the residency match process. Higher scores significantly increase your chances of matching into your preferred specialty and program.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;">💼</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Medical Licensure</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">Passing all three steps is required to obtain a medical license in the U.S. Without it, you cannot legally practice medicine regardless of your medical degree.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center;">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;">🌍</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">International Recognition</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">For IMGs (International Medical Graduates), strong USMLE scores are essential for ECFMG certification and gaining a competitive edge in the U.S. residency match.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CAREER PATHS & SPECIALTIES -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:white;">
    <div class="sec-center" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div class="stag">CAREER PATHS</div>
      <h2 class="stitle">Specialties & <span>Score Requirements</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:28px;">Different medical specialties have different competitive score thresholds. Understanding where you need to be helps you set realistic goals and plan your preparation effectively.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;" class="career-grid">
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">🫀</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Cardiology / Surgery</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Highly competitive — target 250+</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">🧠</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Neurology / Radiology</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Competitive — target 240+</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">👶</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Pediatrics / Internal Medicine</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Moderately competitive — target 230+</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">🏥</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Family Medicine / Psychiatry</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Accessible — target 220+</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">🦴</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Orthopedics / Dermatology</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Most competitive — target 255+</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sky-bg);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;">🔬</div>
          <div><h5 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:2px;">Pathology / Research</h5><p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;">Less score-dependent — target 220+</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE FUTURE OF THE USMLE -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--off-white);">
    <div class="sec-center" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div class="stag">LOOKING AHEAD</div>
      <h2 class="stitle">The Future of the <span>USMLE</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:28px;">The USMLE continues to evolve. In 2022, Step 1 transitioned to pass/fail scoring, shifting the competitive weight to Step 2 CK. This has reshaped how students approach their preparation and how programs evaluate applicants.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;" class="guide-grid">
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">📊</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Step 1 is Pass/Fail</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">Since January 2022, Step 1 is reported as pass/fail only. While the pressure of a numeric score is removed, passing remains essential — and Step 2 CK now carries more weight.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">📈</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">Step 2 CK is King</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;">With Step 1 going pass/fail, Step 2 CK has become the primary differentiator in residency applications. A strong Step 2 CK score is now more important than ever for competitive specialties.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;">🤖</div>
          <h4 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;">AI & Adaptive Testing</h4>
