      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>What's the difference between Plus and Premium?</span><span class="faq-q-icon">+</span></div><div class="faq-a"><strong>Plus</strong> is billed per week (1, 2, or 3 weeks) and is ideal for short, intense revision windows. <strong>Premium</strong> is billed per month (1, 2, or 3 months) and adds <strong>Monthly Status Reports</strong> on top of everything in Plus. Both tiers give you unlimited test blocks, unlimited notes views, unlimited previous tests, progress tracking, usage tracking, and future updates.</div></div>
