      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>What does the Free tier include?</span><span class="faq-q-icon">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">The Free tier gives you 5 Premium Test Blocks, 50 Notes views, and 5 Previous tests. Progress tracking, usage tracking, future updates, and monthly status reports are not included — upgrade to Plus or Premium for the full experience.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span>What happens when my subscription expires?</span><span class="faq-q-icon">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Your account automatically reverts to Free-tier limits. You can renew or upgrade at any time from the same page — no data is lost.</div></div>
